      "note": [
        "Correction 2016-05-20. Data for 2014 regarding central government sector have been corrected.",
        "2018-06-19 Corrected.",
        "Number of employees refer to employees in the salary population (for a description of the salary population, see the documentation for each survey). Refers to employees aged 18-68 for whom we can report salaries. \r\n \r\nFrom 2023, the age demarcation in the salary population has been increased from 66 years to 68 years. \r\n \r\nFrom 2014, the age demarcation in the salary population has been increased from 18–64 years to 18–66 years. \r\n \r\nFor the years 1995–1999 employees on leave of absence are included among the statistical information for the governmental sector. Priests are included in the statistical information for The Church of Sweden. The Church of Sweden has been included in the private sector since 2000.",
        "From 2025, Danderyds Sjukhus AB, S:t Eriks Ögonsjukhus AB,  Södersjukhuset AB and Södertälje Sjukhus AB were added to Region Stockholm, with a total of 13,000 employees."
